#decision("Safety rules live in code, not only in the prompt")[
*Options:* instruct the model to be safe, or enforce safety in code. *Choice:* code; the prompt repeats the rules but cannot override them, since injected text or user pressure can talk a model out of an instruction << cite('greshake_2023') >>. *Consequence:* warnings, refusals and the lock behave the same in every mode, and T15 tests them exhaustively.
]

